                <td>2.  Schedule 1</td>
                <td>At the same time as item 1 of Schedule 1 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Legislation Amendment Act 2012 commences.</td>
                <td>12 April 2013</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>21.  Schedule 3, Part 10</td>
                <td>The later of:
(a) immediately after the commencement of the provision(s) covered by table item 2; and
(b) immediately after the commencement of section 5 of the National Gambling Reform Act 2012.
However, the provision(s) do not commence at all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur.</td>
                <td>12 April 2013
(paragraph (a) applies)</td>
